  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORPART</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of NORPART, the Norwegian Partnership Programme for Global Academic Cooperation, is to enhance the quality of higher education in Norway and developing countries through academic cooperation and mutual student mobility.</narrative>
  </description>
